{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>ShadowClip 是一款專為保護隱私設計的圖片編輯工具，適合經常與同事或朋友分享截圖的用戶。它能自動偵測並移除畫面中的個人數據、API 金鑰及金融資訊，確保你在發送前已清除所有敏感內容。目前該應用正提供限時免費下載。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-14.webp\">\n<h2>智能識別多重敏感資訊</h2>\n<p>ShadowClip 能自動偵測超過 20 種格式的 API 金鑰、信用卡號、國民身分證字號、電郵地址、電話號碼、IP 位址、人臉、QR Code 及條碼等。它支援 30 種語言的文字檢查，包括中文、日文及阿拉伯文，並在本地端進行不可逆的像素級別遮罩處理，確保原始資料徹底消失且無網路傳輸風險。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-307-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-308-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-309-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-310-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-311-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：ShadowClip</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T21:00:00.356869+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":315,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T20:47:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T15:38:13.993181+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T20:57:45.447083+00:00","content_hash":"ff9b5a8a9e0ad167331fa3f87b1d67e1423e1cff71b7798f56e4a6ee3868c3ef","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}